			None


---
Whether a token kind opens a bracket group, closes one, or does neither. Inside
a group a newline is not significant (`lex/lexer.brp` tracks the depth).
---
enum GroupDelimiter:
	OpensGroup
	ClosesGroup
	NotGroupDelimiter


---
The group effect of `kind`. Every kind is listed, with no `_` arm, on purpose:
a new token kind does not compile until someone decides whether it opens or
closes a bracket group.
---
pure func group_delimiter(kind: TokenKind) -> GroupDelimiter:
	match kind:
		LeftParenSymbol | LeftBracketSymbol | LeftBraceSymbol:
			OpensGroup
		RightParenSymbol | RightBracketSymbol | RightBraceSymbol:
			ClosesGroup
		FuncKeyword | PureKeyword | VarKeyword | UnionKeyword | RecordKeyword | VoidKeyword | WhileKeyword | ForKeyword | InKeyword | IfKeyword | ElseKeyword | AndKeyword | OrKeyword | NotKeyword | OnKeyword | MatchKeyword | TrueKeyword | FalseKeyword | BreakKeyword | ContinueKeyword | DebugKeyword | StructKeyword | EnumKeyword | WithKeyword | ResourceKeyword | ForeignKeyword | PrivateKeyword | BuiltinKeyword | ConcurrentKeyword | ConcurrentlyKeyword | DetachKeyword | SelectKeyword | IntoOpaqueKeyword | FromKeyword | FromOpaqueKeyword | AfterKeyword | SealedKeyword | OpaqueKeyword | TryKeyword | ImportKeyword | AsKeyword | TraitKeyword | ImplementsKeyword | SelfKeyword | TypeKeyword | AliasKeyword | WhereKeyword:
			NotGroupDelimiter
		CommaSymbol | ColonSymbol | DotSymbol | DotDotSymbol | DotDotDotSymbol | ArrowSymbol | FatArrowSymbol | EqualSymbol | QuestionEqualsSymbol | PlusSymbol | MinusSymbol | StarSymbol | SlashSymbol | PlusEqualSymbol | MinusEqualSymbol | StarEqualSymbol | SlashEqualSymbol | UnderscoreSymbol | PercentSymbol | HashSymbol | AtSymbol | PipeSymbol | EqualEqualSymbol | NotEqualSymbol | LessSymbol | LessEqualSymbol | GreaterSymbol | GreaterEqualSymbol:
			NotGroupDelimiter
		IdentifierToken | DimensionNameToken | IntLiteralToken | FloatLiteralToken | NormalStringToken | RawStringToken | InterpolatedStringToken | PipeStringToken | RawPipeStringToken | InterpolatedPipeStringToken | CharLiteralToken | DocStringToken | NewlineToken | IndentToken | DedentToken | EndOfFileToken:
			NotGroupDelimiter


